# declaration from a caller with NO pane has no actor and is refused — nothing is written.
# This is the product's behaviour, and since A.1 it is the ONLY behaviour: the bash body
# that fell back to the main agent is gone with every other no-core fallback, so the pin
# is on the core and nothing else can answer. Without this arm the canary above passes
