unset state_events_before state_nopane_rc state_nopane_out
# A.1: `requests` carries no invariant of its own at all — it is a shim that EXECs the
# pinned core, which owns the pending/replied rule. What the generated artifact must
# still carry is the shim, and a missing name there is invisible to the unit suite
# (which calls the function straight out of ae) and shows up only at runtime, so run
