# TMPDIR, so that TMPDIR must be one we control and one the installer provably
# receives. The suite's `TMPDIR=$(mktemp -d)` keeps its export attribute only
# because macOS exports TMPDIR already; on a host where it is not pre-exported
# the installer would fall back to /tmp and every residue assertion here would
